#: consent-manager-pro.php
msgid "https://github.com/rtgit003/consent-manager-pro"
msgstr "https://github.com/rtgit003/consent-manager-pro"

#. Description of the plugin
#: consent-manager-pro.php
msgid ""
"Displays a GDPR-compliant cookie consent banner, generates the legal pages "
"(Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, Cookie Policy) and keeps a consent "
"audit log. Quick to configure, multilingual-ready."
msgstr ""
"Displays a GDPR-compliant cookie consent banner, generates the legal pages "
"(Privacy Policy, Terms & Conditions, Cookie Policy) and keeps a consent "
"audit log. Quick to configure, multilingual-ready."

