#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:76
msgid ""
"Schimbi stilul? Colțurile, umbra, lățimea, butoanele și animația revin la "
"valorile noului stil, iar tu îți pierzi ajustările."
msgstr ""
"Change the style? Corners, shadow, width, buttons and animation go back to "
"the new style's values, and you lose your adjustments."

#. translators: %s: contrast ratio, e.g. 5.2
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:78
#, php-format
msgid "Contrast %s:1, trece."
msgstr "Contrast %s:1, passes."

#. translators: 1: contrast ratio, 2: proposed colour (#rrggbb), 3: its contrast ratio
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:80
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:165
#, php-format
msgid "Contrast %1$s:1, sub 4,5:1. Nuanța propusă: %2$s (%3$s:1)."
msgstr "Contrast %1$s:1, below 4.5:1. Proposed shade: %2$s (%3$s:1)."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:81
msgid "Scrie o culoare în forma #rrggbb."
msgstr "Enter a colour as #rrggbb."

#. translators: %d: how many more removed parts are not listed
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:98
#, php-format
msgid "… și încă %d."
msgstr "… and %d more."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:100
msgid "Am eliminat din CSS-ul propriu:"
msgstr "Removed from your custom CSS:"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:101
msgid ""
"regulile care ar putea ascunde, micșora sau deosebi butoanele „Accept” și "
"„Refuz”, adresele spre alte site-uri și @import. Restul CSS-ului e salvat."
msgstr ""
"rules that could hide, shrink or set apart the “Accept” and “Reject” "
"buttons, addresses pointing to other sites, and @import. The rest of the CSS "
"is saved."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:120
msgid "Aspect salvat."
msgstr "Appearance saved."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:148
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:446
msgid "Nu se aplică în modul Light."
msgstr "Does not apply in Light mode."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:159
msgid "Consent Manager — Aspect"
msgstr "Consent Manager — Appearance"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:160
msgid ""
"Cum arată bannerul pe site. Ce alegi aici nu poate face bannerul neconform: "
"„Accept” și „Refuz” rămân la fel de vizibile."
msgstr ""
"How the banner looks on the site. Nothing you choose here can make the "
"banner non-compliant: “Accept” and “Reject” stay equally visible."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:162
msgid ""
"Ești în modul Light. Câmpurile care nu se aplică cardului Light sunt "
"dezactivate: formatul și poziția, fundalul, lățimea, butoanele, "
"redeschiderea și textele butoanelor din Pro. Valorile lor salvate rămân."
msgstr ""
"You are in Light mode. The fields that do not apply to the Light card are "
"disabled: format and position, backdrop, width, buttons, reopen button and "
"the Pro button texts. Their saved values are kept."

#. translators: 1: contrast ratio, 2: proposed colour (#rrggbb), 3: its contrast ratio
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:165
msgid ""
"Accentul ales e greu de citit. Bannerul îl folosește oricum, dar îți "
"recomandăm nuanța propusă."
msgstr ""
"The chosen accent is hard to read. The banner uses it anyway, but we "
"recommend the proposed shade."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:168
msgid ""
"Tema nu declară culori cu nume cunoscute (background sau base, foreground "
"sau contrast, primary sau accent). Bannerul folosește paleta aleasă."
msgstr ""
"The theme declares no colours with known names (background or base, "
"foreground or contrast, primary or accent). The banner uses the chosen "
"palette."

#. translators: 1: the theme's colour (#rrggbb), 2: contrast ratio, 3: proposed colour (#rrggbb), 4: its contrast ratio
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Culoarea principală a temei (%1$s) are contrast %2$s:1, sub 4,5:1, așa că "
"bannerul folosește culoarea paletei. Pentru o culoare apropiată de a temei, "
"pune ca accent nuanța propusă: %3$s (%4$s:1)."
msgstr ""
"The theme's main colour (%1$s) has a contrast of %2$s:1, under 4.5:1, so the "
"banner uses the palette's colour. For a colour close to the theme's, set the "
"proposed shade as the accent: %3$s (%4$s:1)."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:177
msgid "Stil"
msgstr "Style"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:182
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "Minimal"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:183
msgid "Brand"
msgstr "Brand"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:184
msgid "Prietenos"
msgstr "Friendly"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:190
msgid ""
"Stilul dă forma: colțurile, umbra, lățimea, butoanele și animația. Brand e "
"aspectul de până acum. Schimbarea stilului reîncarcă aceste valori; le poți "
"ajusta apoi mai jos."
msgstr ""
"The style sets the shape: corners, shadow, width, buttons and animation. "
"Brand is the look you had so far. Switching the style reloads these values; "
"you can then adjust them below."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:194
msgid "Culori"
msgstr "Colours"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:196
msgid "Paletă"
msgstr "Palette"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:204
msgid "Preia din temă"
msgstr "Use the theme's colours"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:205
msgid ""
"„Preia din temă” citește paleta temei (theme.json): fundalul, textul și "
"culoarea principală. Folosește doar culorile care trec verificarea de "
"contrast (4,5:1); restul rămân din paleta aleasă. Se aplică doar cu tema "
"„Luminos”."
msgstr ""
"“Use the theme's colours” reads the theme's palette (theme.json): "
"background, text and main colour. Only the colours that pass the contrast "
"check (4.5:1) are used; the rest stay from the chosen palette. It applies "
"only with the “Light” theme."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:207
msgid "Accent"
msgstr "Accent"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:211
msgid "Folosește nuanța propusă"
msgstr "Use the proposed shade"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:213
msgid ""
"Opțional: culoarea butoanelor și a linkurilor. Verificăm contrastul cu "
"textul butonului și cu fundalul (minimum 4,5:1). Gol = culoarea paletei."
msgstr ""
"Optional: the colour of the buttons and links. We check its contrast with "
"the button text and with the background (at least 4.5:1). Empty = the "
"palette's colour."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:217
msgid "Font"
msgstr "Font"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:220
msgid "Fontul sistemului (ca până acum)"
msgstr "System font (as before)"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:221
msgid "Fontul temei"
msgstr "Theme font"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:226
msgid "Temă"
msgstr "Theme"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:231
msgid "Luminos"
msgstr "Light"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:232
msgid "Întunecat"
msgstr "Dark"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:233
msgid "Automat"
msgstr "Automatic"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:234
msgid "Ca site-ul"
msgstr "Like the site"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:240
msgid ""
"Automat urmează setarea de culoare a dispozitivului vizitatorului. „Ca site-"
"ul” face bannerul întunecat când pagina are clasa sau atributul de mai jos "
"pe html sau body; altfel rămâne luminos."
msgstr ""
"Automatic follows the colour setting of the visitor's device. “Like the "
"site” makes the banner dark when the page has the class or attribute below "
"on html or body; otherwise it stays light."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:242
msgid "Selector pentru tema întunecată a site-ului"
msgstr "Selector for the site's dark theme"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:248
msgid "Format și poziție"
msgstr "Format and position"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:250
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:252
msgid "Bară pe toată lățimea"
msgstr "Full-width bar"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:253
msgid "Card într-un colț"
msgstr "Card in a corner"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:254
msgid "Fereastră"
msgstr "Window"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:260
msgid "Jos"
msgstr "Bottom"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:261
msgid "Sus"
msgstr "Top"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:264
msgid "Dreapta jos"
msgstr "Bottom right"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:265
msgid "Stânga jos"
msgstr "Bottom left"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:266
msgid "Dreapta sus"
msgstr "Top right"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:267
msgid "Stânga sus"
msgstr "Top left"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:270
msgid "Mijloc centru"
msgstr "Middle center"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:271
msgid "Sus centru"
msgstr "Top center"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:272
msgid "Jos centru"
msgstr "Bottom center"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:278
msgid "Poziție"
msgstr "Position"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:286
msgid "Pe telefon, bannerul apare ca bandă jos, indiferent de format."
msgstr ""
"On phones the banner shows as a strip at the bottom, whatever the format."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:291
msgid "Fundal"
msgstr "Backdrop"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:294
msgid "Întunecare și blur"
msgstr "Dim and blur"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:295
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:298
msgid "Întunecare"
msgstr "Dim"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:296
msgid "Fără fundal (pagina rămâne folosibilă)"
msgstr "No backdrop (the page stays usable)"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:301
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Blur"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:304
msgid ""
"Întunecarea: 0–80%; gol = valoarea paletei. Blurul: 0–10 px; pe telefoane "
"rămâne doar întunecarea."
msgstr ""
"Dim: 0–80%; empty = the palette's value. Blur: 0–10 px; on phones only the "
"dim remains."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:309
msgid "Detalii"
msgstr "Details"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:311
msgid "Colțuri"
msgstr "Corners"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:315
msgid "Umbră"
msgstr "Shadow"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:317
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:360
msgid "Fără"
msgstr "None"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:318
msgid "Mică"
msgstr "Small"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:319
msgid "Medie"
msgstr "Medium"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:320
msgid "Mare"
msgstr "Large"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:323
msgid "Lățime max"
msgstr "Max width"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:326
msgid "Margine"
msgstr "Margin"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:329
msgid ""
"Colțuri 0–24 px, lățimea maximă 360–960 px (doar în Pro), distanța față de "
"marginea ecranului 0–40 px."
msgstr ""
"Corners 0–24 px, max width 360–960 px (Pro only), distance from the screen "
"edge 0–40 px."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:333
msgid "Butoane"
msgstr "Buttons"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:338
msgid "Plin"
msgstr "Solid"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:339
msgid "Contur"
msgstr "Outline"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:340
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:377
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Text"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:346
msgid ""
"„Accept” și „Refuz” arată mereu la fel: același stil, aceeași mărime. Nu "
"există setare separată pe buton."
msgstr ""
"“Accept” and “Reject” always look the same: same style, same size. There is "
"no separate setting per button."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:351
msgid "Texte"
msgstr "Texts"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:357
msgid "Animație"
msgstr "Animation"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:361
msgid "Apariție"
msgstr "Fade in"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:362
msgid "Alunecare"
msgstr "Slide"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:364
msgid "Întârziere"
msgstr "Delay"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:367
msgid ""
"Vizitatorii care cer mișcare redusă nu văd animația. Întârzierea (0–2 s) "
"amână doar afișarea: trackerele rămân blocate de la început."
msgstr ""
"Visitors who ask for reduced motion do not see the animation. The delay (0–2 "
"s) only postpones the display: trackers stay blocked from the start."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:371
msgid "Redeschidere"
msgstr "Reopen button"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:376
msgid "Iconiță"
msgstr "Icon"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:378
msgid "Ambele"
msgstr "Both"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:379
msgid "Deloc"
msgstr "None"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:385
msgid ""
"Un buton plutitor (jos-stânga) care redeschide preferințele, după ce "
"vizitatorul a ales. Recomandat: „Deloc”, cu un link „Setări cookie” în "
"footer: shortcode-ul [cmp_cookie_settings_link] sau un link de meniu cu URL-"
"ul #cmp-settings."
msgstr ""
"A floating button (bottom left) that reopens the preferences after the "
"visitor has chosen. Recommended: “None”, with a “Cookie settings” link in "
"the footer: the [cmp_cookie_settings_link] shortcode or a menu link with the "
"URL #cmp-settings."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:390
msgid "Excluderi"
msgstr "Exclusions"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:393
msgid ""
"Paginile pe care bannerul nu se deschide singur: o adresă pe rând, de "
"exemplu /contact/. Pune * la final pentru toate paginile care încep așa, de "
"exemplu /landing/*. Pe un site cu limba în adresă, scrie câte un rând pentru "
"fiecare limbă (/ru/landing/*)."
msgstr ""
"Pages where the banner does not open by itself: one address per line, for "
"example /contact/. Put * at the end for all pages that start that way, for "
"example /landing/*. On a site with the language in the address, write one "
"line per language (/ru/landing/*)."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:394
msgid ""
"Blocarea rămâne activă și acolo: fără acord, trackerele nu se încarcă. "
"Vizitatorul își poate deschide setările din linkul din footer sau din "
"butonul de redeschidere."
msgstr ""
"Blocking stays on there too: without consent, trackers do not load. Visitors "
"can open their settings from the footer link or the reopen button."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:398
msgid "CSS propriu"
msgstr "Custom CSS"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:401
msgid ""
"Se adaugă după CSS-ul bannerului, în ambele moduri. La salvare eliminăm "
"@import, adresele spre alte site-uri și regulile care ar putea ascunde, "
"micșora sau deosebi butoanele „Accept” și „Refuz” (de exemplu regulile "
"pe .cmp__btn--primary sau [data-cmp-action=\"reject\"]). Îți arătăm ce am "
"eliminat."
msgstr ""
"Added after the banner's CSS, in both modes. On save we remove @import, "
"addresses pointing to other sites and rules that could hide, shrink or set "
"apart the “Accept” and “Reject” buttons (for example rules on .cmp__btn--"
"primary or [data-cmp-action=\"reject\"]). We show you what we removed."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:403
msgid "Variabile disponibile"
msgstr "Available variables"

#. translators: %s: example CSS rule
#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:404
#, php-format
msgid "Le setezi pe .cmp (sau .cmp-light pentru modul Light), de exemplu %s."
msgstr "Set them on .cmp (or .cmp-light for Light mode), for example %s."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:415
msgid "Salvează aspectul"
msgstr "Save appearance"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:427
msgid "Titlu banner"
msgstr "Banner title"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:428
msgid "Text introductiv"
msgstr "Intro text"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:429
msgid "Text notice (Light)"
msgstr "Notice text (Light)"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:430
msgid "Buton „Accept\""
msgstr "“Accept” button"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:431
msgid "Buton „Doar necesare\""
msgstr "“Necessary only” button"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:432
msgid "Buton „Gestionează\""
msgstr "“Manage” button"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:433
msgid "Buton „Confirmă selecția\""
msgstr "“Confirm selection” button"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:434
msgid "Titlu preferințe"
msgstr "Preferences title"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:446
msgid "Doar în modul Light."
msgstr "Light mode only."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:453
msgid ""
"Site-ul folosește WPML sau Polylang. Textele de mai jos sunt cele de bază; "
"le traduci în pluginul de traduceri, ca până acum."
msgstr ""
"The site uses WPML or Polylang. The texts below are the base texts; you "
"translate them in the translation plugin, as before."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:454
msgid "Deschide traducerile textelor"
msgstr "Open the text translations"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:457
msgid "(implicit)"
msgstr "(default)"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:463
msgid "Câmp gol = textul implicit al limbii (arătat în câmp, estompat)."
msgstr ""
"Empty field = the language's default text (shown greyed out in the field)."

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:464
msgid "Limba textelor"
msgstr "Language of the texts"

#: includes/admin/class-appearance-page.php:490
